s run by an NPC called <a href=\"/wiki/Raffina_Caldera\" title=\"Raffina Caldera\">Raffina Caldera</a>.</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 266px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/30/MagmaShopLocation.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315222651\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Picture of the magma tree area, a red arrow showing where the Magma Cave Shop is located.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/30/MagmaShopLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/266?cb=20240315222651\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"266\" height=\"221\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"MagmaShopLocation.png\" data-image-key=\"MagmaShopLocation.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:MagmaShopLocation.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Picture of the magma tree area, a red arrow showing where the Magma Cave Shop is located.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Boxed_Lava\" title=\"Boxed Lava\">Boxed Lava</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Boxed_Lava.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315204101\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Boxed Lava\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Boxed_Lava.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20240315204101\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Boxed Lava.png\" data-image-key=\"Boxed_Lava.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$5,280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian_Skull\" title=\"Obsidian Skull\">Obsidian Skull</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315204241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Obsidian Skull\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20240315204241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Obsidian Skull.png\" data-image-key=\"Obsidian_Skull.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$200,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Lantern\" title=\"Lava Lantern\">Lava Lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/25/Lava_lantern_Unboxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309192659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lava lantern Unboxed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"239\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lava lantern Unboxed.png\" data-image-key=\"Lava_lantern_Unboxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/25/Lava_lantern_Unboxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250309192659\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/25/Lava_lantern_Unboxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309192659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lava lantern Unboxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/25/Lava_lantern_Unboxed.pn