element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Molten Moai.png\" data-image-key=\"Molten_Moai.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cf/Molten_Moai.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20240423083114\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$7,980\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Memorabilia\" title=\"Goblin Memorabilia\">Goblin Memorabilia</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/61/Goblin_Memorabilia.png/revision/latest?cb=20240316000005\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Goblin Memorabilia\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"219\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Goblin Memorabilia.png\" data-image-key=\"Goblin_Memorabilia.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/61/Goblin_Memorabilia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/188?cb=20240316000005\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$75,000\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Secrets\">Secrets</span></h2>\n<p>If you look closely you'll find a few <b>Greedy Greeb Goblins</b> hidden around the room. One of them stands on the entrance of a small hole on the ceiling. Entering this hole leads to the Goblin Memorabilia, and another path above, to which the item can be brought back down the shop.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; fon